for you to rate and review the show. So if you're listening on your phone, if you go to the show and then scroll down, and then you can click read reviews and write a review. I would be so very grateful. I think there can be a pressure to think, I need to know everything, I need to know everything. And I think it's that kind of juggle of breadth of experience versus depth of experience. And so it might just be worth a quick check-in with actually, am I putting pressure on myself to know all of these things, or could I give myself permission to really, you know, really go deeper on my knowledge and my skills in this area? So to focus on my depth of experience. Because believe me, at interview, if you've got depth of experience when you're asked a

