your answers to some questions. If you don't like writing, you might find it helpful to drop yourself voice notes, perhaps on WhatsApp. That's my favourite place to drop myself memos. And I think some good questions to mull over are these. What will I genuinely gain from this move? What will I genuinely lose from this move? Am I still developing where I'm currently working?

